  "semantics": [
    "QueueAction remains opaque. QueueActionWithPhase shares the same registration and Tick code; descriptor and callback occupy one record, including original origin capture.",
    "Each queued callback has its own phase gap or captured state. Queue order and remainingTime are preserved; executed callbacks leave no detached metadata.",
    "Swap Run reads live h.Delays.Swap; observation copies that same dependency without invoking Run. Native h.swap(to) closure, action timing, cooldown bookkeeping, normal resets and event order are unchanged.",
    "Swap descriptor records captured destination key and current destination index. Active actor, dash state, swap cooldown and character counters remain represented by existing player/character phase providers.",
    "All original movement callbacks and delayed stamina task bodies are retained. Observe never invokes gameplay callbacks, Stat, AbilStamCost or UseStam.",
    "Stellar Jump keeps both airborne branches and its live JumpModified/Airborne condition; it is not converted to Classic fixed timing."
  ],
